Lupin the Fire!

180
00:12:39,524 --> 00:12:41,524
Let me show you my everything

181
00:12:41,524 --> 00:12:44,824
眩しい眼差しをうけて
Basking in your dazzling gaze,

182
00:12:44,824 --> 00:12:48,324
君のために今日を捨てるよ (it's show time)
For you, I will throw away today. (It's show time!)

183
00:12:48,324 --> 00:12:50,024
世界で一人の最愛の
To my one and only beloved in the world,

184
00:12:50,024 --> 00:12:52,324
君自身に気持ち伝えたいよ
I want to convey my feelings to you directly.

185
00:12:52,324 --> 00:12:54,024
僕が欲しいのは物じゃない
What I want isn't a mere object...

186
00:12:54,024 --> 00:12:56,124
あなたのハート
...it's your heart!

187
00:12:56,124 --> 00:12:58,024
普段はとぼけた三枚目
Usually a goofy comic relief,

188
00:12:58,024 --> 00:12:59,824
やる時ゃ誰より真剣で
But when the time comes, more serious than anyone.

189
00:12:59,824 --> 00:13:01,824
頼りになるいざという時
Reliable when it really counts.

190
00:13:01,824 --> 00:13:03,824
こうなりたい誰が見ても素敵
I want to be like that—stunning to everyone who watches.

191
00:13:03,824 --> 00:13:05,524
知性備えたスーパーマン
A Superman equipped with intellect,

192
00:13:05,524 --> 00:13:07,424
横にはお決まりスーパーウーマン
And by his side, the usual Superwoman.

193
00:13:07,424 --> 00:13:09,324
残り二小節ラストスパート
The final spurt with two bars left,

194
00:13:09,324 --> 00:13:12,024
憧れの男 lupin the third
The man of our admiration, Lupin the Third!

195
00:13:15,524 --> 00:13:19,524
獲物は確かにいただいたぜ
I have indeed taken the prize!

196
00:13:23,524 --> 00:13:31,024
はい！ということで 「Grateful Days」と「ルパン・ザ・ファイヤー」 2曲続けて聴いていただきました！
Yes! And with that, you heard "Grateful Days" and "Lupin the Fire," two songs back-to-back!

197
00:13:31,024 --> 00:13:37,024
「Grateful Days」はですね ええと 男性二人と女性一人の曲なんですけど
Now, "Grateful Days" is a song for two males and one female,

198
00:13:37,024 --> 00:13:41,524
女性のところはね 絶対アズちゃんが良いってことでアズちゃん で
and for the female part, I absolutely wanted Azu-chan, so Azu-chan was a must. And...

199
00:13:41,524 --> 00:13:46,524
ラップパートはもう ノエルちゃんの顔しか浮かばなかったので ノエルちゃんにお願いしました 二人ともありがとう！
for the rap part, only Noel-chan's face came to mind, so I asked her. Thank you both!

200
00:13:46,524 --> 00:13:53,024
でね ルパンの映像が流れてみんなびっくりしたんじゃない？ ころねもびっくりした
And that Lupin footage playing, weren't you all surprised? Korone was surprised, too!

201
00:13:53,024 --> 00:13:57,024
で 今日のハッシュタグは もうね 7周年だって すごいよね
And as for today's hashtag, it's our 7th anniversary already, which is amazing, right?

