00:14:03,024 --> 00:14:07,024
スクショも大丈夫だよ
Taking screenshots is totally fine, too.

204
00:14:07,024 --> 00:14:15,524
ね ここのステージ なんか今日は違った感じだけど ここはどこなんでしょうか どこ？
You know, this stage... feels a bit different today. Where exactly are we? Where?

205
00:14:15,524 --> 00:14:20,024
「INU VALLEY」！素敵 今日はイヌバレーから
"INU VALLEY"! Awesome! Today, from Inu Valley...

