トラベラーになれたら
and become a traveler...

343
00:23:43,047 --> 00:23:46,547
俺ってやつはいつも気付いた時は手遅れ
I'm the type who always notices when it's too late.

344
00:23:46,547 --> 00:23:50,047
絵空事ばかり うつつ抜かして
Just indulging in wishful thinking,

345
00:23:50,047 --> 00:23:53,047
大事な人すら救えない
I can't even save important people.

346
00:23:53,047 --> 00:23:56,547
だからこんな歌で自分に言い聞かせて
So I tell myself with a song like this.

347
00:23:56,547 --> 00:23:59,547
あの時 あいつは多分気を使って
At that time, that person was probably being considerate,

348
00:23:59,547 --> 00:24:03,047
とくに顔色変えず 何もないふり
especially with no change in expression, pretending nothing was wrong.

349
00:24:03,047 --> 00:24:06,047
なんでいわないんだってムカついてもね
Even if I got angry, asking "Why don't you say it?",

350
00:24:06,047 --> 00:24:09,547
やさしさからきてたなら しょうがないね
if it came from kindness, it can't be helped, right?

351
00:24:09,547 --> 00:24:12,047
願わくばディスコで親父と母さんが会った日に行きたいね
I wish I could go to the day my dad and mom met at a disco.

352
00:24:12,047 --> 00:24:15,547
後ろのジョックスに酒 かけて息子じきじきにチャンス作ってやるぜ
Pouring alcohol on the jocks in the back, I'll create a chance for my son directly.

353
00:24:15,547 --> 00:24:19,047
どんなでかい時計だってすべてさ 始まりはこんな小さい歯車
No matter how big the clock is, everything begins with such a small gear.

354
00:24:25,047 --> 00:24:31,047
細かいことはもういいや 疲れた
I don't care about the details anymore, I'm tired.

355
00:24:31,047 --> 00:24:34,547
別に怒ってないってさ 未来は
I'm not angry, the future is...

356
00:24:46,047 --> 00:24:49,047
人はこれって時にどうしても
People at times like this, no matter what,

357
00:24:49,047 --> 00:24:52,047
「時間を戻せたら」とかいうね
say, "If only I could turn back time..."

358
00:24:52,047 --> 00:24:55,547
浅はかでも直せないよ 治せないんだな
But no one can fix it, can't fix it, huh?

359
00:24:55,547 --> 00:24:59,047
昔からそうだし まぁしょうがないね
It's always been like that, well, it can't be helped, right?

360
00:25:00,095 --> 00:25:02,595
きっと先は深く不安定
Surely the future is deep and unstable,

361
00:25:02,595 --> 00:25:06,095
でも お行儀よくちゃ つまんないね
but being well-behaved is just so boring, right?

362
00:25:06,095 --> 00:25:08,895
タイムマシーンに乗り込んで
Let's board the time machine,

363
00:25:08,895 --> 00:25:11,595
トラベラーになれたら
and if I could become a traveler...

364
00:25:25,095 --> 00:25:25,895
Done.

365
00:25:58,095 --> 00:25:58,795
Yo

366
00:25:58,795 --> 00:26:02,895
シボレーのドアを蹴り開けて 街に飛び出した俺たち
We kicked open the Chevy's doors and ran out into the streets.

367
00:26:02,895 --> 00:26:07,895
暴力、酒に女、音楽 中指立てる大人の仮面に
Violence, booze, girls, and music—flipping off the masks of adults.

368
00:26:07,895 --> 00:26:12,195
Oh さぁ踊ろう 「今日」という日を生き急ぐメンバー
Oh, let's dance, members rushing through this day called "today."

369
00:26:12,195 --> 00:26:17,095
足りねえか？ Little louder! 欲望渦巻く路上が現場
Not enough? Little louder! The desire-swirling street is our stage.

370
00:26:17,095 --> 00:26:21,895
Yeah いつだってそうだろ ブルーハーツ、尾崎、永ちゃんが教科書
Yeah, it's always been that way. Blue Hearts, Ozaki, and Yazawa are our textbooks.

371
00:26:21,895 --> 00:26:26,595
くたばるまで格好つけて 誓ったよ あの放課後
Acting cool until we drop, we made a promise back then after school.

372
00:26:26,595 --> 00:26:31,095
俺らピーターパン 「またいつか」なんて言っちゃいかん保存
We are Peter Pans, we must never say "someday again."

373
00:26:31,095 --> 00:26:35,595
嘲笑っとる大人に言ってやる 人生はたったの一回だ
Let's tell those sneering adults: you only live once!

374
00:26:35,595 --> 00:26:40,095
胸の奥底 初期衝動
Deep in my chest, the primal urge.

375
00:26:40,095 --> 00:26:44,895
見て見ぬフリ No, No
Pretending not to see? No, No.

376
00:26:44,895 --> 00:26:49,895
夢追い笑われ 傷だらけでギラつく My way
Chasing dreams, laughed at, scarred but shining on my way.

377
00:26:49,895 --> 00:26:54,895
Go on! You should know who we are, Forever Young

378
00:26:54,895 --> 00:26:59,495
Hey! Just next to me from now 大切なことは
Hey! Just next to me from now, the important thing...

379
00:26:59,495 --> 00:27:03,595
魂の状態 Forever Young
...is the state of your soul. Forever Young.

380
00:27:03,595 --> 00:27:08,895
Hey! It's your turn next time from here 「あの目始めれば良かった」
Hey! It's your turn next time from here. "I wish I had started that day."

381
00:27:08,895 --> 00:27:13,595
その次の始めるべき時は今
The next best time to start is right now.

382
00:27:13,595 --> 00:27:17,895
高笑いする都会の喧騒 ウケ狙いならば振り向けんぞ保存
The roaring laughter of the city's hustle, if you're just looking for laughs, we won't turn back.

383
00:27:17,895 --> 00:27:22,595
何連呼？忘れろ？ 夢流した便所 見下ろしてきやがる摩天楼
What did you repeat? Forget it? The toilet where dreams were flushed, looking down is the skyscraper.

384
00:27:22,595 --> 00:27:27,595
Oh まるで勝新みたく破天荒 伝説へとアテンド保存
Oh, wild and unprecedented like Shintaro Katsu, escorting us to a legend.

385
00:27:27,595 --> 00:27:32,095
怖にゃあ怖にゃあてその程度 捨てろ負け惜しみ 過去の栄光
Scared, scared? Is that all you've got? Throw away your sore loser excuses and past glory.

386
00:27:32,095 --> 00:27:36,595
永遠なんそはねぇて いつか天へ召され ペンで書き殴った
There's no such thing as eternity. Someday we'll ascend to heaven, written with a pen...

387
00:27:36,595 --> 00:27:41,295
この魂は2PACみたく誰かの心を通過
...this soul, like 2PAC, will pass through someone's heart.

388
00:27:41,295 --> 00:27:46,095
なぁ 何か忘れちゃねぇか 人生まるで映画 皆がエンターテイナー
Hey, haven't we forgotten something? Life is just like a movie, everyone is an entertainer.

389
00:27:46,095 --> 00:27:51,095
思い出せ 思想は現実化する 誰がHighway飛ばすBentayga
Remember, thoughts become reality. Who's speeding down the highway in a Bentayga?

390
00:27:51,095 --> 00:27:55,595
胸の奥底 初期衝動
Deep in my chest, the primal urge.

391
00:27:55,595 --> 00:28:00,095
見て見ぬフリ No, No
Pretending not to see? No, No.

392
00:28:00,095 --> 00:28:05,095
夢追い笑われ 傷だらけでギラつく My way
Chasing dreams, laughed at, scarred but shining on my way.

393
00:28:05,095 --> 00:28:10,095
Go on! You should know who we are, Forever Young

394
00:28:10,095 --> 00:28:14,595
Hey! 俺たちは今日だって 若気の至りのような
Hey! Even today, we...

395
00:28:14,595 --> 00:28:19,095
夢を追いかけてきた Forever Young
...have been chasing dreams like youthful indiscretions. Forever Young.

396
00:28:19,095 --> 00:28:24,095
Hey! 変わるはずなんてない さぁやってやろうぜ 今日は
Hey! There's no way we'll change. Come on, let's do this! Today...

397
00:28:24,095 --> 00:28:28,595
残された人生で一番若い日だろ
...is the youngest day of our remaining lives, right?

398
00:28:28,595 --> 00:28:33,095
半端な覚悟ならドブに捨てな 永遠
If you have half-hearted determination, throw it in the gutter. Eternity!

399
00:28:33,095 --> 00:28:37,595
往生際が悪いってめぇ 笑い飛ばし 誇れ Better days
They say we don't know when to give up. Laugh it off and be proud of better days.

400
00:28:37,595 --> 00:28:41,595
まだ終わらない 終わらせやしない 燃え尽きるまで 永遠
It's not over yet. We won't let it end until we burn out. Eternity!

401
00:28:41,595 --> 00:28:46,095
まだ終わらない 終わらせやしない くたばるまで 永遠
It's not over yet. We won't let it end until we drop dead. Eternity!

402
00:28:46,095 --> 00:28:50,095
Forever Young

403
00:28:50,095 --> 00:28:54,095
もう夢を追いかけ 本気になった心は
The heart that chased dreams and became serious...

404
00:28:54,095 --> 00:28:58,595
自分の指図も受けない Forever Young
...doesn't even take directions from itself. Forever Young.

405
00:28:58,595 --> 00:29:03,595
Hey! その思いから逃れられないなら
Hey! If you can't escape from that feeling......

406
00:29:03,595 --> 00:29:08,595
自ら向かうだけ
...then just go towards it yourself.

407
00:29:08,595 --> 00:29:12,595
終わらせやしない 燃え尽きるまで 永遠
We won't let it end until we burn out. Eternity!

408
00:29:12,595 --> 00:29:17,095
まだ終わらない 終わらせやしない くたばるまで 永遠
It's not over yet. We won't let it end until we drop dead. Eternity!

409
00:29:17,095 --> 00:29:22,095
まだ終わらない まだ終わらない Forever Young
It's not over yet! It's not over yet! Forever Young.

410
00:29:22,095 --> 00:29:28,095
そう今日という日は お前に残された人生の一番若い日
Yes, today is the youngest day of your remaining life.

411
00:29:34,095 --> 00:29:36,595
ふふふ
Fufu...

412
00:29:36,595 --> 00:29:40,095
マリン、来てくれてありがとう！
Marine, thank you for coming!

413
00:29:40,095 --> 00:29:43,095
呼んでくれてありがとう！イェーイ！
Thank you for inviting me! Yay!

414
00:29:43,095 --> 00:29:48,595
いや、マジでこの「Forever Young」って曲をマリンと一緒に歌いたかったの。
Seriously, I really wanted to sing this song, "Forever Young," with you, Marine.

415
00:29:48,595 --> 00:29:52,095
ああ、それはマリンがおばさんにならないように？
Oh, so that Marine won't turn into an old lady?

416
00:29:52,095 --> 00:29:55,295
そう！もうForeverのYoungだって思ってるから！
Yeah! Because I think you're Forever Young!

417
00:29:55,295 --> 00:29:59,095
そうだね、永遠にヤングだね！みんな、みんな！保存
That's right, forever young! Everyone, everyone!

418
00:30:00,070 --> 00:30:01,070
悩む！
It's hard to decide!

419
00:30:01,070 --> 00:30:01,870
うー。
Mmm...

420
00:30:01,870 --> 00:30:04,270
でもマリン、今日はね、今日はね...
But Marine, today, you see...

421
00:30:04,270 --> 00:30:05,470
え、後ろ見て？
Look behind you.

422
00:30:05,470 --> 00:30:07,570
演奏してくれてる！
They're performing for us!

423
00:30:07,570 --> 00:30:09,370
気まずいよ！
This is awkward!

424
00:30:09,370 --> 00:30:11,870
今日はね、演奏してくれてるのみんなが。
Today, everyone is playing for us.

425
00:30:11,870 --> 00:30:13,270
乗ってるよ。乗ってるよ。
They're grooving! They're grooving!

426
00:30:13,270 --> 00:30:16,170
乗ってるでしょ？え、どの、どの人と写真撮りたい？
They're grooving, right? Which one do you want to take a picture with?

427
00:30:16,170 --> 00:30:19,470
えー、そんな、一人だけみたいな、そんな、なんか...
Eh, just choosing one... That's kind of...

428
00:30:19,470 --> 00:30:22,670
いやいや、二人選んでいい、二人選んでいい。
No, no, you can choose two! Choose two.

429
00:30:22,670 --> 00:30:24,470
かわいそうじゃん、選ばれなかったら。
It'd be sad for the one not chosen.

430
00:30:24,470 --> 00:30:26,570
二人選ぼう、二人選ぼう。
Let's choose two! Let's choose two.

431
00:30:26,570 --> 00:30:29,370
俺もう、コロねスキがなんか...
I mean, the Koronesuki look kind of...

432
00:30:29,370 --> 00:30:31,570
いいよ、マリンが選ぶんだよ。
It's fine, Marine will choose.

433
00:30:31,570 --> 00:30:33,270
あ、マリンが選ぶ、あ、うん。
Ah, Marine will choose? Ah, okay.

434
00:30:33,270 --> 00:30:35,470
どう？最初は...
How about... First is...

435
00:30:35,470 --> 00:30:37,370
待って、映して、後ろ。
Wait, show them. The background.

436
00:30:37,370 --> 00:30:39,170
みんな下向いて。
Everyone, look down.

437
00:30:39,170 --> 00:30:43,070
細犬さん？
Hosoinu-san?

438
00:30:43,070 --> 00:30:45,370
かわいい！かわいい！
So cute! So cute!

439
00:30:45,370 --> 00:30:49,070
じゃあ細犬、まず細犬と写真撮ろっか。
Then, let's take a photo with Hosoinu first.

440
00:30:49,070 --> 00:30:51,570
かわいいよ、細犬。こっちおいで、マリン、こっちにね。
He's cute, Hosoinu. Come here, Marine, this way.

441
00:30:51,570 --> 00:30:54,070
はい、細犬でーす。えーと、細犬はギターかな？
Yes, it's Hosoinu. Um, is Hosoinu on guitar?

442
00:30:54,070 --> 00:30:56,270
あ、ギターですか？細犬ちゃん。
Ah, are you playing the guitar, Hosoinu-chan?

443
00:30:56,270 --> 00:30:57,670
ベロの色が...
The color of his tongue is...

444
00:30:57,670 --> 00:30:59,270
乾いてる、ベロ。
His tongue is dry.

445
00:30:59,270 --> 00:31:02,870
ベロ乾い、ちょっと、吸い出されてるんだけど、ベロの...
His tongue is dry... Wait, it's being sucked in...

446
00:31:02,870 --> 00:31:04,270
あ、乾いてる。
Ah, it's dry.

447
00:31:04,270 --> 00:31:06,570
うん、乾いてる。あんまり触らないでね。
Yeah, it's dry. Don't touch it too much.

448
00:31:06,570 --> 00:31:09,070
ごめんね、いっぱい触って。
Sorry for touching you so much.

449
00:31:09,070 --> 00:31:11,270
え、次、誰がいい？
Who's next?

450
00:31:11,270 --> 00:31:13,470
かわいい。あと一人、あと一人。じゃあ、太犬？
Cute. One more, one more. Then... Futoinu?

451
00:31:13,470 --> 00:31:14,870
太犬だね。
Futoinu, right?

452
00:31:14,870 --> 00:31:18,870
はい、太犬はドラムです！かわいい！
Yes, Futoinu is on drums! So cute!

453
00:31:18,870 --> 00:31:21,070
でかい！
He's huge!

454
00:31:21,070 --> 00:31:25,070
どぅるどぅるどぅるどぅる...
Drum roll...

455
00:31:25,070 --> 00:31:28,070
かわいいね。
So cute.

456
00:31:28,070 --> 00:31:30,870
ベロの色がちょっと明るい。
His tongue is a bit brighter.

457
00:31:30,870 --> 00:31:33,270
細犬より。
Than Hosoinu's.

458
00:31:33,270 --> 00:31:35,870
撮った？みんな撮った？
Did you take it? Did everyone take it?

459
00:31:35,870 --> 00:31:38,270
イェーイ！撮った？かわいい！
Yay! Did you take it? So cute!

460
00:31:38,270 --> 00:31:39,870
オッケーだね。
We're good then.

461
00:31:39,870 --> 00:31:41,270
うん、オッケー。
Yeah, okay.

462
00:31:41,270 --> 00:31:44,270
え、じゃあ最後さ、二人でも撮ろうよ、二人でも。
Then at the end, let's take one with just the two of us too.

463
00:31:44,270 --> 00:31:46,870
あ、そうだね、二人でも撮ろう、二人でも。
Ah, right, let's take one together too.

464
00:31:46,870 --> 00:31:49,070
二人で、はい、ポーズ。
The two of us, okay, pose.

465
00:31:49,070 --> 00:31:51,070
え？
Huh?

466
00:31:51,070 --> 00:31:53,070
ちょっと...
Wait...

467
00:31:53,070 --> 00:31:55,570
あ、ごめんごめん、やっぱりじゃあね...
Ah, sorry, sorry. After all...

468
00:31:55,570 --> 00:31:58,570
じゃあね、やっぱり一人で撮りたいみたいだから。
It seems they want to take solo photos after all.

469
00:31:58,570 --> 00:32:00,570
あ、やっぱりね。
Ah, as expected.

470
00:32:00,570 --> 00:32:02,070
コロねスキだもんね。
Because they're Koronesuki.

471
00:32:02,070 --> 00:32:03,570
撮りますか。
Shall we take one?

472
00:32:03,570 --> 00:32:07,070
コロねスキ、ころさん好き？
Koronesuki, do you like Koro-san?

473
00:32:07,070 --> 00:32:09,070
好き？ころさん好き？
Like me? Do you like Koro-san?

474
00:32:09,070 --> 00:32:11,070
あ、よかった。え、マリンも好き？
Ah, good. Um, do you like Marine too?

475
00:32:11,070 --> 00:32:13,070
間に入ろう。
Let's squeeze in.

476
00:32:13,070 --> 00:32:14,570
なんでだよ！
Why?!

477
00:32:14,570 --> 00:32:18,070
コロねスキなのにころさんの隣に立てない気分どう？
How does it feel to be a Koronesuki but not be able to stand next to Koro-san?

478
00:32:18,070 --> 00:32:20,570
嬉しい？マリンが隣で。
Are you happy Marine is next to you?

479
00:32:20,570 --> 00:32:22,570
嬉しくない？
Not happy?

480
00:32:22,570 --> 00:32:25,070
本当は好きなんでしょ？
You actually like me, don't you?

481
00:32:25,070 --> 00:32:27,570
おい！やめろ、やめろよ！
Hey! Stop it, stop it!

482
00:32:27,570 --> 00:32:30,070
だめ、もうだめ、帰るよ。帰るよ、もう。
No, forget it, I'm going home. I'm leaving.

483
00:32:30,070 --> 00:32:31,570
はい、帰ろう。はい、帰ろう。
Okay, let's go. Let's go.

484
00:32:31,570 --> 00:32:34,570
はい、今日はね、このバンドメンバーがいましたけれど。
Yes, today we had these band members with us, but...

485
00:32:34,570 --> 00:32:36,070
ええ。はい。
Yes. Right.

486
00:32:36,070 --> 00:32:38,070
え、マリンとも最後に撮りたい。
Wait, I want to take a photo with Marine at the end too.

487
00:32:38,070 --> 00:32:40,570
あ、撮ろう、撮ろう、撮ろう。せっかくね。
Ah, let's take it, let's take it. Since we're here.

488
00:32:40,570 --> 00:32:42,570
フォーエバーヤングだから、今日は。
Because it's Forever Young today.

489
00:32:42,570 --> 00:32:44,070
マイク、マイク！
Microphone, microphone!

490
00:32:44,570 --> 00:32:47,070
マイク持って！マイク！
Hold the mic! Mic!

491
00:32:47,070 --> 00:32:48,570
間違え、間違えちゃってるけどさ。
I got it wrong, I got it wrong, but...

492
00:32:48,570 --> 00:32:50,070
マイクね。うん、いいよ、いいよ。
The mic, yeah, it's fine, it's fine.

493
00:32:50,070 --> 00:32:52,570
でかい声で喋ると拾うから！
If you speak in a loud voice, it'll pick it up!

494
00:32:52,570 --> 00:32:54,070
取れた？
Did we get it?

495
00:32:54,070 --> 00:32:55,570
いけてる？
Is it working?

496
00:32:55,570 --> 00:32:57,070
太犬！
Futoinu!

497
00:32:57,070 --> 00:32:58,570
中心として。
As the center.

498
00:32:58,570 --> 00:33:00,070
え、かわいく撮れたね。
Ah, it turned out cute.

499
00:33:00,070 --> 00:33:01,570
ありがとう、マリン。
Thank you, Marine.

500
00:33:01,570 --> 00:33:04,570
ありがとう。ね、ちょっと次の曲があるから行くけど。
Thank you. Hey, I have to go because of the next song, but...

501
